                                                "sense_id": "92718a3f-552d-37a9-ac07-0669d9e49923",
                                                "text": "Oh many a peer of England brews\nLivelier liquor than the Muse,\nAnd malt does more than Milton can\nTo justify God's ways to man."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
